==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|оубити}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*ubiti}}. {{surf|ru|у-|бить}}.

Compare {{cog|uk|уби́ти}}, {{cog|sh|ùbiti}}, {{cog|sl|ubíti}}.

